abstract: "A public, bilingual (English and Bengali) archive of government notifications, Acts, public-hearing notices, reports and court records on Other Backward Classes reservation in West Bengal, with plain-language notes, a notification timeline, a litigation tracker and full-text search. A research aid, not legal advice."
keywords:
  - "Other Backward Classes"
  - "OBC reservation"
  - "West Bengal"
  - "Calcutta High Court"
  - "Supreme Court of India"
  - "public records"
  - "Bengali"
